    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brennan Property are delighted to present this beautifully maintained two bedroom mews townhouse in a quiet, gated community. 4 The Mews offers a rare blend of privacy, space and convenience in the heart of Ashtown, Dublin 15. Extending to 71 sq. m. (760 sq. ft.), this bright, modern home is an ideal choice for first time buyers, downsizers or anyone seeking a stylish Dublin base with its own front door and private garden.\r\n\r\nInside, the ground floor features a welcoming entrance hall, cloakroom and under stairs storage, a large guest WC, a modern fully fitted kitchen, and a spacious living room flooded with natural light from a striking roof light. Double glazed doors open onto a beautifully landscaped, decked garden, a perfect retreat.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you’ll find two double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, including a rear bedroom with balcony views over the garden and park. A bright, fully tiled bathroom with power shower, additional landing storage and a floored, insulated attic complete the picture. The home also benefits from an upgraded combi gas boiler and two secure underground parking spaces.\r\n\r\nSet within a peaceful enclave, residents enjoy easy access to the Royal Canal walkway, Tolka Valley Park and the Phoenix Park, along with excellent local shops, cafés, gyms, creches, schools and transport links. Pelletstown and Ashtown Train Stations are just a 10 minute walk away, connecting you quickly to Dublin City Centre, Maynooth and the LUAS at Broombridge. The N3, M50 and Dublin Airport are all within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\n•\tOwner occupied from new\r\n•\tTwo double bedrooms with built in wardrobes\r\n•\tPrivate landscaped garden with decked area\r\n•\tModern kitchen with quartz worktop and quality appliances\r\n•\tBright living room with roof light and garden access\r\n•\tLarge main fully tiled bathroom with power shower\r\n•\tTimber flooring throughout\r\n•\tGuest WC on ground floor\r\n•\tFloored, insulated attic with folding stairs\r\n•\tTwo secure designated underground parking spaces\r\n•\tGas fired heating, combi gas boiler, and double glazed windows=\r\n•\tQuiet gated community with excellent amenities nearby\r\n•\t10 minute walk to Pelletstown and Ashtown Train Stations; easy access to LUAS\r\n•\t15 mins by train to Dublin City Centre\r\n•\tClose to Royal Canal Greenway, Phoenix Park, N3, M50 and Dublin Airport"
      },
      {
